From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8192fs: disable the bridge extension

The bridge extension depends on the removed IPX and AppleTalk wire
structures. Disable it on the 7.3 build.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -75,7 +75,7 @@
 CONFIG_SIGNAL_SCALE_MAPPING = n
 CONFIG_80211W = y
 CONFIG_REDUCE_TX_CPU_LOADING = n
-CONFIG_BR_EXT = y
+CONFIG_BR_EXT = n
 CONFIG_TDLS = n
 CONFIG_WIFI_MONITOR = n
 CONFIG_MCC_MODE = n
